  "description": "LOKWER crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H96 N8 O40 Tb8. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb7 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb8 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.635-3.858 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.18-116.40°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C80 H96 N8 O40 Tb8. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
